      "type": "cover",
      "title": "Present continuous",
      "subtitle": "Presente continuo: lo que pasa ahora",
      "goals": [
        "Formar el presente continuo: **am / is / are + -ing**.",
        "Escribir bien el **-ing**: *making, running, studying*.",
        "Distinguir **ahora** (continuo) y **siempre** (simple)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "To be + verbo con -ing",
      "table": {
        "head": ["", "Forma", "Ejemplo"],
        "rows": [
          ["Afirmativa", "am / is / are + verbo**-ing**", "I'**m studying**. She'**s working**."],
          ["Negativa", "am not / isn't / aren't + -ing", "They **aren't listening**."],
          ["Pregunta", "Am / Is / Are + sujeto + -ing?", "**Are** you **watching** TV?"]
        ]
      },
      "list": [
        "La mayoría: **+ ing** → *play → playing, read → reading*",
        "Termina en **-e**: quita la e → *make → making, write → writing*",
        "Una sílaba con consonante-vocal-consonante: **dobla** → *run → running, sit → sitting, swim → swimming*",
        "**-ie → -ying**: *lie → lying, die → dying*"
      ],
      "tip": "Palabras típicas: **now, right now, at the moment, today, Look!, Listen!**"
    },
    {
      "type": "examples",
      "title": "¿Qué está pasando?",
      "items": [
        { "en": "I'm **doing** my homework right now.", "es": "Estoy haciendo mi tarea ahorita." },
        { "en": "Look! It's **raining**.", "es": "¡Mira! Está lloviendo." },
        { "en": "Shh! The baby is **sleeping**.", "es": "¡Shh! El bebé está dormido." },
        { "en": "Are you **listening** to me? — Yes, I am.", "es": "¿Me estás escuchando? — Sí." },
        { "en": "We aren't **working** today.", "es": "Hoy no estamos trabajando." }
      ]
    },
    {
